[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car on a ramp.</p><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584925\">5530B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584928\">5530B52</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584236\">1048A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584260\">1072C44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584206\">1032D12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584771\">4450B04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584325\">1092B68</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584328\">1092C11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584331\">1092D10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584321\">1092A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584194\">1032B14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584168\">1016C11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584583\">2110A60</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584172\">1020A30</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584171\">1020A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584290\">1084B28</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolts fixing the connecting rod cap.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2020906.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>Remove the piston complete with connecting\nrod.</p>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Use the tool (1a) and fit the piston (1b) in the cylinder chamber\n(1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Fitting tool</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.700.000</p></td></tr></table></div><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Make sure that the arrow, stamped\non the piston crown, is facing the timing side and that the number,\nstamped on the big end, corresponds to the one of the connecting\nrod cap.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2020907.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>Position the connecting rod caps and secure\nthem by tightening the bolts to the recommended torque using the\nangle wrench.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>CONNECTING ROD CAP FASTENERS</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>2 + 40°</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Protractor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.942.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2584290\">1084B28</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584171\">1020A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584172\">1020A30</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584583\">2110A60</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584168\">1016C11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584194\">1032B14</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584321\">1092A12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584331\">1092D10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584328\">1092C11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584325\">1092B68</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584771\">4450B04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584206\">1032D12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584260\">1072C44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584236\">1048A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584928\">5530B52</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584925\">5530B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584254\">1068A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584120\">0010T11</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a></p><p>Remove the vehicle from the ramp.</p>"]]